Saturday night is here and my special dinner is ready.
The doorbell rings.
I open the door and see Asha.
Her dog, Moti, is also with her.
Moti wags his tail happily and comes inside.
Asha smiles and says, "Hello Maya, it smells amazing!"
I invite them inside and we sit at the dining table.
I serve my new fusion food.
It has Mexican beans and fresh Indian spices.
Asha tastes the food and is very happy.
She says, "Maya, this food is very delicious."
I smile and thank her.
While eating, we talk about plans for Sunday.
Asha says that she will go to the market tomorrow.
I say that I will just rest at home.
Under the table, Moti touches my leg.
He is also asking for our food.
I laugh and say, "No Moti, this is too spicy for you!"
Asha pets him and gives him a biscuit.
This evening passes with good conversation and good food.
